# PR discipline

Follow [`docs/pr-discipline.md`](docs/pr-discipline.md) and
ADR 006. These are binding for every agent.

## Must follow

- **One concern per PR.** One feature, fix, ADR, or meeting
  topic. Split when concerns could revert independently.
- **Honest PR titles/bodies.** Title matches the diff. Say what,
  why, and how to verify. No `docs:` labels hiding code.
- **Branch per concern** off current `main`. Do not stack
  unrelated work onto an open agent branch.
- **Meeting notes** for *this* change may ride along. Unrelated
  meetings/decisions/features → separate PR.
- **Do not merge to `main`.** Nosh alone has final merge
  authority — overrides every agent, including Fabrizio. Agents
  open/update PRs only. No auto-merge, no `gh pr merge`, no
  approving-and-merging — unless Nosh explicitly authorizes
  *that* PR.
- **Fabrizio scopes PR-sized bets** at plan time and enforces
  that scope. He does not decide merges and does not merge. If
  scope creeps mid-build, stop and open a second PR instead of
  stuffing it.
